{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready For A Real Fight?</h2><br>Brawl with 540 million players from all over the world! Lords Mobile is a real strategy game in the war time. In the game you can choose army troops and hero formations the way you want, create a badass city, make the best alliances to annihilate millions of enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/93042bbae2a41bd2e979a133f1b0c4e8.poster.avif?t=1753929753\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/93042bbae2a41bd2e979a133f1b0c4e8.webm?t=1753929753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/93042bbae2a41bd2e979a133f1b0c4e8.mp4?t=1753929753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Features]:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 \u25b6 Build Your Own Kingdom \u25c0\u25c0</h2>Upgrade buildings, conduct research, train your troops, level your Heroes and lead your Kingdom well to prosper!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/402800953bc144b03ddb7a1eb1e576c2.poster.avif?t=1753929753\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/402800953bc144b03ddb7a1eb1e576c2.webm?t=1753929753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/402800953bc144b03ddb7a1eb1e576c2.mp4?t=1753929753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 \u25b6 Utilize Troop Formations \u25c0\u25c0</h2>4 different troop types, and 6 dif